<title>UK: Bankgesellschaft unit prices $250 million Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Bankgesellschaft unit prices $250 million Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Salomon Brothers International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BGB FINANCE (IRELAND) PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BANKGESELLSCHAFT BERLIN AG</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     7.125     MATURITY    27.FEB.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.371    PAY DATE    27.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES   0.50     REOFFER    99.371    SPREAD	+70 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  GOV LAW     ENGLISH</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    30 BP     SELL CONC  20 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
